2 CONT CHAGATAI, son of JENGHIZ Khan ([1185]-[1240/41]).  Abul-Ghazi Bahadur names “Djaghatai Khan” as the second son of “Tchinguiz Khan”[197].  He inherited the former Uighur and Kara Khitai territories in central Asia after the death o
2 CONC f his father in 1227[198].  He was murdered by the Assassins[199]. 
