1 NOTE {geni:about_me} This profile links our branch of the Dolgov nobility (Tambov Governorate, Part 6) directly to the medieval roots of the Saburov family. According to historical rolls and the Velvet Book, Zakhariy Murza Chet entered
2 CONC  Russian service in 1330 from the Golden Horde, cementing the patrilineal link to the Chingosid (Mongol Imperial) bloodline via Atdun and Qulkan.
2 CONT
