2 CONT Instead of accepting this decision, Pādšāh, allegedly on the instigation of her sister Bibi Tarkān, filed a complaint against Buqā Chingsāng, who had supported Soyurḡatmeš’s claim.  This turned out to be a grave mistake.  On Buqā’
