2 CONT * Heravi (Persian: هروی, also Romanized as Herby)[1] is a village in Meydan Chay Rural District, in the Central District of Tabriz County, East Azerbaijan Province, Iran. At the 2006 census, its population was 2,399, in 640 famili
2 CONC es.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Its fame is due to its pleasurable climate & amazing nature. Herbi is also known for its damask rose.
