2 CONC e/Arpa-KEUN-Arpa-Kaun-Ilkhan-of-the-House-of-Tolui-d-1336/6000000039300370333] on Jaghatu plains near Maragha on 29 April 1336. Arpa's army were led by 60 emirs, notably Hajji Taghay (son of Sutai, Governor of Diyar Bakr, from Oir
2 CONC ats), Uyghur commander Ögrünch, Torut (a son of Nari and relative of Narin Taghay), Ortuq-Shah (son of Alghu) and Chupan's son Sorgan Sira [https://www.geni.com/people/Sorghan-Siyurghan/6000000038602883890]. 
