2 CONC  they had received as inheritance from their grand-father; on which account his uncle Shahrukh Mirza, having defeated him in a battle, put out both his eyes. This circumstance took place in A.D. 1414 A.H. 817.] ref. An Oriental Bi
2 CONC ographical Dictionary, Thomas William Beale.
