1 NAME DELETE Ali Gholi Khan /Moghadam - Head of the Moghadam tribe and of the Maragheh khanate and khan of Maragheh as of 1725 after it was liberated by Nadergholi Afshar. Hostage of Karim Khan Zand./
2 GIVN DELETE Ali Gholi Khan
