2 CONT  Grekov 1998, p. 286-287.
2 CONT  Osipov, Yuri (ed.). "Едегей" [Edegey]. Great Russian Encyclopedia. Vol. 9 (1 ed.). Moscow: Great Russian Encyclopedia. ISBN 978-5-85270-369-9.
2 CONT  Fadeeva 2001, p. 100.
