1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sayid Ahmad I From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia Jump to navigation Jump to search Sayid Ahmad I Khan of the Golden Horde Reign	1433 – 1455 Predecessor	Ulugh Muhammad Successor	Küchük Muhammad Born	unknown Died	
