1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sous Mohammad Shah Qajar Gouverneur de Kashan - Yazd - Fars. Gouverneur de Maragheh sous Mohammad Shah Qajar et Nasseredin Shah Qajar
2 CONT -------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.wikiwand.com/en/Mirza_Hossein_Khan Hussein Pasha-aga was a military leader in the state of Qajar . From Abbas-Mirza received the title of Khan. Hussein Pasha-Khan had a son, Kasym -khan . He was also a military man. He 
2 CONC had the rank of colonel (sarheng ).
2 CONT ---------------
2 CONT Hossein Pasha Adjudan Bashi est le petit fils de Ahmad Khan Moghadam Javanshir (Rish Sepid).
2 CONT ---------------
2 CONT Hossein Pasha Khan participated in the invasion of Herat with the Maragheh battalion and he was the first commander to enter Herat. He was killed on the battle of Ganja and Jafar Gholi Khan was injured. Hossein Khan Moghadam Javan
2 CONC shir, Ahmad Khan's son, was in the military at an early age. He was in the cabinet of Mohammad Khan Amir Nezam Zangeneh, at the service of Abbas Mirza. He progressed from being an assistant and commander of the Maragheh army to be
2 CONC ing Adjudan Bashi of all of Azarbaijan and then of the entire Iranian army. In 1875, he was total and extraordinary ambassador of Iran for Austria, France and England. After his return to Iran, he became governor of Yazd. In 1881,
2 CONC  he became governor of Fars. ... (ref: Part des gens de Karabakh dans la politique et la dynastie Qajar نقش قره باغیها در سیاست و حکومت دوره قاجار (voir A_GhareBagh.pdf dans documents [media])
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------
2 CONT Ambassadeur de France, Angleterre, Autriche, sous Mohammad Shah Qajar Hossein Pacha Khan Javanshir Moghadam qui etait, sous Nasseredin Shah, le commandant de la troisieme armee de Maragheh. (Bataillon SIM) Vakil de Yazd en 1840. M
2 CONC irza Hossein Khan Ajudan Bashi was a 19th-century Iranian diplomat. He was a Member of the Maragheh Khanate. He was sent to France in 1839 by the Persian ruler Mohammad Shah Qajar following the conflict between Persia and Great Br
2 CONC itain over the possession of Herat in Afghanistan. In the wake of the Herat affair, Great Britain would remove its military and diplomatic missions from Persia, and occupy Kharg island and attack Bushehr.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT By dispatching Mirza Hossein Khan, Mohammad Shah Qajar resumed diplomatic relations with France. The diplomatic mission reached Louis-Philippe and asked for military help. In response, a group of French officers was sent to Persia
2 CONC  with the returning ambassador.[2] Louis-Philippe said:
2 CONT
2 CONT     "God is my witness that we are pleased to receive [the Shah's] friendly greetings and we wish with all our heart, and throughout our life, to enjoy friendship and sincerity in our relations with the Shah".
2 CONT     â€” Louis-Philippe.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Mirza Hossein Khan also visited Vienna and London as Ambassador Extraordinary, where Palmerston refused to receive him and rejected his mission. He died 1866-67. He left a son Ali Khan, who died in 1884
2 CONT
2 CONT Hossein Khan e Jouji Maraghei 
2 CONT -------------------
2 CONT Les jardins Nezam ud Dowleh etaient sa propriete; ils sont aujourd'hui l'Ambassade d'Angleterre a Shiraz. https://fa.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D8%A8%D8%A7%D8%BA_%D9%86%D8%B8%D8%A7%D9%85%E2%80%8C%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%AF%D9%88%D9%84%D9%87 htt
2 CONC ps://fa.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D8%A8%D8%A7%D8%BA_%D9%86%D8%B8%D8%A7%D9%85%E2%80%8C%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%AF%D9%88%D9%84%D9%87
2 CONT -------
2 CONT
2 CONT Hossein Khan etait le fils de la soeur de Jafar Khan Moshir ud dowleh
2 CONT
2 CONT Hossein Pasha Khan etait le petit fils (le fils du fils ) de Ahmad Khan Moghadam Javanshir (Agha Khan e Avval):https://www.geni.com/people/Amir-Agha-Soltan-Ghazi-Soltan-de-Maragheh-Agha-Khan-e-Avval-Aga-Khan-Hussein-Khan-ghouls-Eb
2 CONC rahim-Sultan-Bodagh-Javanshir-1672/6000000043984952214 
2 CONT
2 CONT Javanshir Moghadam - commandant du 3eme bataillon de Maragheh sous Nassereddin Shah Qajar حسین خان خواهر زاده میرزا جغفر خان مشیرالدوله است.
2 CONT  حسین پاشاخان نوه پسری احمد خان
2 CONT
2 CONT [... Le fils de Ahmad Khan, Hossein Pasha Khan avec 3 armees de fantassins de Maragheh et 250 cavalierss et 120 canons, entra le premier dans Herat avec Soltan Murad Mirza Ehsam ol Saltaneh. Le fils de Hossein Pasha Khan, Eskandar
2 CONC  Khan Moghadam, pere de Fathollah Khan Zafarol dowleh, fut tue dans le desert de Koklan et fut enterre a Asrarabad. Zafar ol dowleh, secretaire de Zafar Ali etait poete. Hossein Khan Moghadam Adjudan Bashi - Nezam ol Dowleh et Far
2 CONC manfarma du Fars, fut envoye comme ambassadeur a Paris et a Londres. Lui aussi descend des Moghadams de Zanjan, de Maragheh et de la frontiere Turque. ] ref: page 129 Les hommes politiques sous les Qajars - Ahmad Khan Malek Sasani
2 CONC .]
2 CONT
2 CONT ==========
