1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Since the year 1560 remained the border fortress Lubecz , designed to prevent invasions of Tartar . In March 1566 appointed Castellan of Kiev . After incorporation Kijowszczyzny the Crown has been a senator, even t
2 CONC hough it has maintained close ties with the Grand Duchy of Lithuania . In 1569 , negotiated during the life of Sigismund Augustus, with members of the French provinces to join back Bratslav , Kiev and Volhynia to return to Lithuan
2 CONC ia in exchange for support of Henry of Valois on the Polish throne.  He participated in planning the war with Ivan the Terrible in April 1580 .  He died in early December 1580 .  He was associated with Calvinism, however, ordered 
2 CONC to bury in a church in Lejpunach.
