1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Esmehan Sultan was the daughter of Şah Sultan and Lütfi Pasha. She was born in Istanbul in 1525. She fell in love with Şehzade Mehmed, son of Sultan Suleiman I and Haseki Hürrem Sultan, and eventually got married t
2 CONC o him. He named her Baharnaz. The couple had one daughter, Hümaşah Sultan. But in 1543, Mehmed died and she went to live with her mother. She died in 1550 in Istanbul.
