1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.currays.net/Gonzalez%20Web%20Project/ps03/ps03_461.htm  ...  Martha Duron Jimenez and Ignacio Narro Etchegaray. ''DICCIONARIO BIOGRAFICO DE SALTILLO'', Mayo 1995, page 128:   '''Juan NAVARRO, a founder o
2 CONC f Saltillo, native of Navarra, was known by the nickname El Vizcaino [a reference to his Basque origins]'''. He '''married Dona Maria RODRIGUEZ, daughter of Capitan Baltasar de SOSA and Dona Ines RODRIGUEZ'''. Their '''children we
2 CONC re:''' '''Beatriz''', whose first marriage was to Capitan Alonso ALBORNOZ and second marriage was to Capitan Bernabe de las CASAS; '''Ursula''', who married Capitan Diego SANCHEZ; '''Melchora''', who married Capitan Martin SANCHEZ
2 CONC ; '''Ines''', who married Capitan Francisco MARTINEZ GUAJARDO; '''Maria''', who married Capitan Jose de TREVINO; '''Francisca''', who married Capitan Juan TARANCO VALLEJO; '''Martin''', who married Maria ROJO de las RUELAS; and ''
2 CONC 'Mariana''' NAVARRO RODRIGUEZ, who married Capitan Marcos GONZALEZ HIDALGO.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''_________________________________'''
2 CONT
2 CONT in 1561 was owner of "estancia" in the valle of Sichu.  Was given land in 1578 in Parras, Coah. On Sept 2 1591 was made Alcalde of Santiago de Saltillo
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://gw5.geneanet.org/sanchiz?lang=en;pz=tomas;nz=sanchez+garza;ocz=0;p=juan;n=navarro+sosa
2 CONT
2 CONT children: 
2 CONT * Beatriz Navarro Rodríguez
2 CONT * Mariana Navarro Rodríguez ca 1571
2 CONT * Úrsula Inés Catarina Navarro Rodríguez
2 CONT
2 CONT ============================
2 CONT
2 CONT Juan NAVARRO765 was born (date unknown).
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Maria RODRIGUEZ. Maria RODRIGUEZ and Juan NAVARRO432 were married. Children were: Beatriz NAVARRO, Ines (Ursula) Rodriguez NAVARRO (aka Ursula Catarina Navarro), Melchora (Ursula Catarina) NAVARRO, Mariana (Juana) NAVARRO.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b165.html#P1012
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Juan Navarro and Maria Rodriguez are: 
2 CONT *1. +Mariana Navarro Rodriguez, b. 1571, ,,,Mexico, d. 1615.
2 CONT *2. +Beatriz Navarro Rodriguez, b. 1604, Nuevo Leon280, d. 1701, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico280.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT From the work of Miguel A. Ayala (webcached 12/28/2012):
2 CONT
2 CONT http://webcache.googleusercontent.com/search?q=cache:http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/a/y/a/Miguel-A-Ayala-TX/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-0326.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Juan Navarro (son of Juan Navarro #1 and Maria Navarro) 
2 CONT *was born Abt. 1533 in Navarre, Spain (unlikely, given that his father had arrived and settled in the New World after the failed attempt by Narvaez to stop Cortes in 1520), and 
2 CONT *died 1594. 
2 CONT *He married (1) Maria Rodriguez Sosa, daughter of Baltazar Castano de Sosa. 
2 CONT *He married (2) Maria Rodriguez Montemayor on Abt. 1574, daughter of Baltazar Castano de Sosa and Inés Rodriguez de Montemayor.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Juan Navarro:
2 CONT
2 CONT Juan Navarro, in 1556 was one of the discoverers and first settlers of the mines of San Martín [347] and in 1561 he was the owner of a farm in the valley of Sichú and was “one of the five on horseback who accompanied Pedro de Ahum
2 CONC ada Sámano in the very dangerous entry into Malpaís, in the war against Guachichiles and Zacatecos, and he was wounded on one side.[348] 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1577 he entered with Alberto del Canto into the founding of Saltillo.[349] On April 1, 1578, Juan Navarro, who is called here Juan Sánchez Navarro, received from Martín López de Ibarra a grant of land in the valley of el Pirine
2 CONC o (Parras, Coah.).[350] 
2 CONT
2 CONT September 2, 1591, he was the mayor of the town of Santiago del Saltillo[351] and on December 15, 1593, deputy of the magistrate of the first mayor.[352] In 1604 we encountered two people with the name of Juan Navarro, one a young
2 CONC  bachelor, inhabitant of Cuencamé and the other, an inhabitant of the valley of Santa Bárbara (Chih.)[353]
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.library.ci.corpus-christi.tx.us/newkingdom/reinochapter4p72.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Juan Navarro:
2 CONT *Date born 2: 1523, Portugal.
2 CONT *Date born 3: Abt. 1533
2 CONT *Juan Navarro and Maria Rodriguez Montemayor Marriage: Abt. 1574
2 CONT
