1 CONT Saunders, J.J. -- The History of the Mongol Conquests, Routledge & Kegan Paul Ltd, 1971, ISBN 0-8122-1766-7 
1 CONT Sicker, Martin -- The Islamic World in Ascendancy: From the Arab Conquests to the Siege of Vienna, Praeger Publishers, 2000 
1 CONT Soucek, Svatopluk -- A History of Inner Asia, Cambridge, 2000 
1 CONT [edit]
